{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Combat｜结构图\n窗口、跨帧扫掠与命中输出。[[Combat/结构|结构文档]] · [[GGYGO_流程_Combat.canvas|运行流程]]\nGA 持原资源；Combat 管查询／去重／Owned 订阅，GAS 管能力生命周期与伤害结算。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1540,
      "height": 125,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "ga",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## PlayerCombo / BossMelee\n认证 Montage Hit 窗口 → Owned 开窗。\nGA 保存 Original、原 Trace、window/token。\nCombo：Step.TraceShape＋原 Mesh。\nBoss：RootTip；Active 重复 Begin 保去重。\n回调核 Activation/声明/Task/原窗；CleanupAbilityResourcesForTermination(Context) 归还自身原资源。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构|GAS权威]] · [[BossAI/结构]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 270,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "trace",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOMeleeTraceComponent\n只有原生 Owned 窗口；蓝图只读 IsTracing。\nShape/原Mesh 预检 → TryOpenOwnedTraceWindow；Expected → Out。\nRootTip 参数也进入同一开窗机制。\nCloseOwnedTraceWindow(H) → 只关原窗。\nQueryOwnedTraceWindow(H) → 当前资格。\nSubscribeWindowHit(H, Callback) → 回调/token。\nUnsubscribeWindowHit(token) → 精确退订。\nPerformTrace → 球扫/PhysicalMaterial。",
      "x": 550,
      "y": 270,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 380,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "mesh",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FGGYGOMeleeTraceShape / TraceChannel\nRootTip：一链两点；SocketChains：至少一链，各取相邻点。\nSocket/Bone 来自角色原主 Mesh。\n各链 WorldRadiusCm 为固定世界厘米。\nTraceChannel 决定碰撞，查询忽略 Owner。",
      "x": 1110,
      "y": 260,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 205,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "memory",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 唯一窗口机制\nWindowSerial＋bIsTracing：原窗身份。\nActiveShape：原配置快照。\nWindowMesh/Asset/World：借用资源弱身份。\nPreviousPoints：全链上帧基线。\nHitActorsThisWindow：跨链弱引用去重。\n组件 Tick 执行；关窗统一退订/清理。",
      "x": 550,
      "y": 670,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "gas",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## GA → Builder / GE / Cue\n同次 HitResult＋原 Avatar 命中时位置 → Builder。\nGA 校验数值并提交 GE/Cue；GAS 结算。\nCombo 依赖失败结束原动作；Boss 拒绝该 hit。\n物材随 HitResult 返回；Trace 不依赖 GAS。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构]] · [[Physics/结构]]",
      "x": 1110,
      "y": 690,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "contract",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 原窗口消费与清理契约\nCombo/Boss 保存原 Activation/Trace/窗口/token；命中前核原来源及 QueryOwnedTraceWindow。消费者资源记录不是另一份活动窗口权威，Activation/结束仍归 GAS。\n原 native hit 传 OriginalWindow、Actor、HitResult；快照订阅并逐项核原窗/token/资源。B 回调关 B 开 C 立即停 B 分发/扫掠/回写，C 自建首基线。\nGA Cleanup 匹配原 Context，先脱自身原资源，再 UnsubscribeWindowHit(原token)/CloseOwnedTraceWindow(原H)；旧身份不清后继。组件生命周期/内部失败用 CloseCurrentTraceWindow，统一退订、停 Tick、清 Shape/借用资源/基线/去重。\n没有无身份开窗入口或全局命中事件；命中只发给原窗口订阅。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1000,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    },
{"id": "area-projectile-query", "type": "text", "x": 1700, "y": 270, "width": 560, "height": 490, "color": "5", "text": "## FGGYGOCombatHitQuery\nOpen(Authority Source, IgnoredActors) → 原查询实例；GA 窗口或弹体寿命持有。\nOverlapSphere／Box(世界几何) → 原 FOverlapResult；不造接触点／法线。\nSweepSphere(原移动段, 半径) → 去重 Actor 的完整 FHitResult＋独立 OutBlockingHit。\nTouch→Block 不受伤害去重吞掉，原弹体据阻挡销毁；同 Actor 只结算一次。\nClose 幂等归还来源／忽略表／去重。\n无 Tick、委托、位移或伤害提交。\n[[Combat/结构|查询接口与验证]]"}
],
